<title>UK: IBCA gives l-term AAA to DSL Bk 1999 bonds.</title>
<headline>IBCA gives l-term AAA to DSL Bk 1999 bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency said on Wednesday it assigned its long-term AAA rating to the Deutsche Siedlungs und Landesrentenbank 30 billion yen 5.4 percent dual currency samurai bonds 1999 issue.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6137</p>
